Installed from https://github.com/rcdailey/home-ops (unraid/ directory).

nfs-drain asks the Kubernetes cluster to scale NFS apps to zero before the array stops.
It runs from /boot/config/stop and from an emhttp "stopping" hook that /boot/config/go installs.
Files, install, test, and removal: docs/runbooks/unraid-nfs-drain.md in that repository.
